      causalLinks: ["Solute and metabolic accumulation -> neuronal dysfunction -> encephalopathy and seizure", "Uremic serosal inflammation -> pericarditis and effusion -> tamponade risk", "Uremic platelet signaling defects -> impaired adhesion and aggregation -> bleeding", "Anorexia plus inflammation and catabolism -> protein-energy wasting -> frailty and infection risk"],
